OL,3,GNEWSATrial date set for man accused of 
OL,4,Amurder                                 
OL,6,FA man has appeared at Bradford Crown   
OL,7,FCourt charged with the murder of a     
OL,8,F46-year-old woman.                     
OL,10,FBilal Ajmal, 26, of Carr Bottom Road,  
OL,11,FLittle Horton, Bradford, is charged    
OL,12,Fwith killing Tahira Hussain, who was   
OL,13,Fpronounced dead at the scene, and the  
OL,14,Fattempted murder of a 20-year-old      
OL,15,Fwoman.                                 
OL,17,FPolice were called to Carr Bottom Road,
OL,18,Fin Little Horton, at about 01:40 GMT on
OL,19,FTuesday following reports of a serious 
OL,20,Fassault on two women.                  
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
